# GitHub Issues — InEngine Core

When creating issues for this repository:

1. Use `gh issue create` in **`InEngine/Core`** with **`--assignee excellentingenuity`** unless the user specifies otherwise.
2. Link related work to Modulus / module packages when relevant (`InEngine/Modulus`, sibling module repos).
3. Keep issue bodies actionable: goal, acceptance criteria, and module boundary (Core vs module).

If `gh` is not authenticated, ask the user to run `gh auth login` before creating issues.
